From: openEuler RISC-V Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] session-lock-qt: support the Qt 6.5 shell API

License: GPL-3.0-or-later
Upstream-Status: downstream-only
Origin: openEuler RISC-V packaging

QWaylandShellSurface did not gain requestActivateOnShow() until Qt 6.8.
Keep the exact method but omit the override specifier so it remains compatible
with Qt 6.5 and still overrides the matching virtual method on Qt 6.8 and
later. The older requestActivate() hook remains available on every version.

Also use the existing m_peddingSize member in the Qt 6.5 expose path. The
upstream spelling m_pendingSize names no member and would otherwise fail at
the next compiler step.

Remove this patch when upstream supports Qt 6.5 or requires Qt 6.8 or later
and no longer compiles the older expose path.

---
 src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp | 2 +-
 src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.h   | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp b/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp
--- a/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp
+++ b/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.cpp
@@ -70,6 +70,6 @@ QWaylandExtLockSurface::sendExpose()
 {
 #if QT_VERSION < QT_VERSION_CHECK(6, 7, 0)
-    window()->handleExpose(QRect(QPoint(), m_pendingSize));
+    window()->handleExpose(QRect(QPoint(), m_peddingSize));
 #elif QT_VERSION < QT_VERSION_CHECK(6, 9, 0)
     window()->sendRecursiveExposeEvent();
 #else
diff --git a/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.h b/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.h
--- a/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.h
+++ b/src/qwaylandextsessionlocksurface.h
@@ -19,6 +19,6 @@ public:
     bool isExposed() const override { return m_configured; }
     void applyConfigure() override;
     bool requestActivate() override;
-    bool requestActivateOnShow() override;
+    bool requestActivateOnShow();
     void setXdgActivationToken(const QString &token) override;
     void requestXdgActivationToken(quint32 serial) override;
